254042797322966%2FlocalPosts%2F5520354176149983909/version/1783605526820000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCKWljr6AnI_OTBIWQ0lITTBvZ0tFUDJrN3VPVDRleWVOURoSQ2dzSWw5Sy0wZ1lRdU1XLUFn\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E5%A5%BD%E5%91%B7%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5X%E7%87%92%E5%92%96%E5%93%A9+%E7%94%9C%E5%93%81%E5%90%83%E5%88%B0%E9%A3%BD(%E4%B8%AD%E5%92%8C)+*%E5%91%B7%EF%BC%9A%E3%84%92%E3%84%A7%E3%84%9A%CB%8A\u0026ludocid\u003d14608388389247623933\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEP2k7uOT4eyeNQ\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5Vfrk525WrkiQqZcRtj7PpP","0ahUKEwikuKuB69GWAxWKf_UHHRYPN6AQ544CCCkoHA",null,"2026年7月9日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u12665254042797322966/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM1NTIwMzU0MTc2MTQ5OTgzOTA5","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u12665254042797322966/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM1NTIwMzU0MTc2MTQ5OTgzOTA5",null,null,null,null,null,["5520354176149983909","CIHM0ogKEP2k7uOT4eyeNQ","CgsIl9K-0gYQuMW-Ag"]]],1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[9],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["🌟 湯頭全面提升\n全新雞骨豚骨湯底，融入老母雞與豬大骨的精華，經12小時慢火熬煮，湯色乳黃、濃郁綿厚，滿滿的膠原蛋白與極致鮮味，讓每一口都像在擁抱溫暖的幸福。\n\n🌟 叉燒香氣升級\n以日本職人工法製作的五花肉燒肉叉燒，搭配國產純釀醬油低溫熟成，炙燒的梅納反應更添濃郁香氣。每一片叉燒都鎖住鮮甜肉汁，入口即化，滿足每一位饕客的期待。\n\n🌟 麵條口感升級\n嚴選美澳黃金小麥，經九道揉壓工法製成的26番切細麵，硬中帶Q，完美吸附湯頭精華。每一口麵條，都是精工細作的體現。\n好呷豆花的三大堅持 |\n✅ 天然非基改大豆：手工鹽滷製作，不含石膏，口感細緻滑嫩。\n✅ 40年傳承秘糖水：嘉義糖廠老員工的獨門技法，選用純甘蔗熬煮，濃郁不膩。\n✅ 綿密配料：飽滿紅豆、古早味大麥、低糖綠豆，每一口都是回憶的味道。\n\n甜品起家的好呷，保留古早味！ 愛吃甜品的朋友們，來好呷拉麵，記得留點胃給這碗 「被拉麵耽誤的豆花」！甜品吃到飽，ho-chia，好呷❤️"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-6opQ3sy5UIc/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/qXhfMvW3u4Q/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,